          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naayakar ayong Damasko, abu ngolo aweikinit akwap ngina ngirwa lua ekapolon Areta, tolimok ngikeyokok atamar keteut ayong alodorin a ere kerumut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
